    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόρριζος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π̔ίζα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under</i> or <i>below the root</i> (sc. navel),
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				493a18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>with piece of root attached,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.1.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				1.2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόρριζον, τό,</span>
			<i>secondary root,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.11
			</span></i>.</div>
